  "releaseNotes": "Updated v1.0.1 =>\n\t\t\t\t- TransactionResult: added ChargedAmount, FormattedChargedAmount fields and GetChargedAmountDecimal() helper\n\t\t\t\t- RefundResponse: rewritten to expose full refund record (id, refund_amount, status, bank_response_*, currency_code, etc.)\n\t\t\t\t- CommissionResponse: added TransactionFee field\n\t\t\t\t- BinLookupResponse: added CardFamilyLogoPath field\n\t\t\t\t- CustomerResponse: added Ip, FormattedUpdatedAt fields\n\t\t\t\t- ProductResponse: added CurrencyId, ProductImageUrl fields",
